====== Keenetic Start (KN-1110) ======

The device is a wireless N router with 
  * 2 fixed antennas
  * 3 Port 100/10 Switch
  * 1 Port 100/10 Wan Interface
  * 16 MB Flash
  * 64 MB Ram


